  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups prepared strong black coffee",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons coffee-flavored liqueur"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y6bbjQvKID2KixHqu36piiyFIzc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8402359-coffee-granita-VAT-4x3-ingredients-866e8c9424944ec1a20edb9d2e6af4aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8402359/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine coffee, sugar, and coffee liqueur in a bowl with a whisk until sugar dissolves.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iXYC-Cvx6M8gIMkndA6DNuKhaQI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8402359-coffee-granita-VAT-4x3-step-01-386efd3be07745ff96163f2fd8c26633.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8402359/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into an 8x12- or 9x13-inch dish. Freeze, uncovered, until it just starts to get slushy around the outside, about 1 hour and 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NlIuLoKlCOKRHnWAVrVGuAnpg84=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8402359-coffee-granita-VAT-4x3-step-02-bb0cd310d4a84f70b6b75e98eb2674d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8402359/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Take a fork and break the frozen pieces up, stirring into the liquid. Crush any large pieces with the back of the fork.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aEQEAhP75dl2iJMDcPWx-lJORW8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8402359-coffee-granita-VAT-4x3-step-03-3185d1c4fb54447382253c1f9f1c2189.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8402359/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to the freezer and repeat the process every 30 minutes until you've reached your desired consistency, about 4 to 5 times total.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SkwOliW2mx0gEriVksoH0DEoWiI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8402359-coffee-granita-VAT-4x3-step-04-a7b85e7d8f3944bd8ccbe7d6ee7ad9fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8402359/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately or return to the freezer and chill for 8 hours, or overnight, before serving for best results.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MZX5gxl84HOIScxIJKUlPo24T6w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8402359-coffee-granita-VAT-hero-4x3-32d4bf7ded0f40c9959125c95046395e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8402359/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
